# API Conventions

## Versioning

- URI versioning: all routes under **`/v1/`** (`VersioningType.URI`, default version `1` in `main.ts`).
- Frontend `apiUrl` includes the prefix: `http://localhost:8200/v1`.
- Controllers use bare paths (`@Controller('users')`) — Nest adds the version segment.

## Validation

Global `ValidationPipe` in `main.ts`:

- `whitelist: true` — strips unknown properties from body/query.
- `transform: true` — coerces query types (numbers, enums).

Use contract **classes** for `@Body()` and `@Query()` so validation runs automatically.

## Throttling

- Global `ThrottlerGuard` in `AppModule` — 20 requests / 10 seconds default.
- Heavy or public endpoints may need `@SkipThrottle()` — use sparingly.

## REST patterns

| Action | Method | Path |
|--------|--------|------|
| List (paged) | `GET` | `/v1/<entity>?page=&limit=&sortBy=` |
| Get one | `GET` | `/v1/<entity>/:id` |
| Create | `POST` | `/v1/<entity>` |
| Update | `PUT` or `PATCH` | `/v1/<entity>/:id` |
| Delete | `DELETE` | `/v1/<entity>/:id` |

List endpoints return `PagedListDto<T>` via mapper `toDtosPaged`.

## Static files

Uploads served at `/v1/uploads` via `ServeStaticModule` — restrict in production if sensitive.

## Cluster

Production runs Node cluster; scheduled tasks and config init run on **`WORKER_NUMBER=0`** only.
